{"about_the_game":"We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.<br>Namely, the dodecahedron and the icosahedron<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/dotris.gif?t=1723635414\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/icotris.gif?t=1723635414\" /><br><br>Psoltrix is the lovechild of Tetris and platonic solids, so these two things never have to be separated again.<br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two game modes, played on a regular dodecahedron and icosahedron, respectively.<br></li><li>Tutorials for an easy introduction to the novel control scheme. <br></li><li>Different difficulty settings for every skill level. <br></li><li>Variable game speed without a skill ceiling. <br></li><li>Many options to individually adjust the visual representation of the playing field. <br></li><li>Fully configurable controls. <br></li><li>Playable with keyboard and controller. </li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2848000?t=1723635414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1723635414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1723635414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1723635414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.<br>Namely, the dodecahedron and th